     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Hello,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">I am Prashant Kumar. I am interested\r\nin participating in Google Summer of Code 2014 by contributing to the R\r\nlanguage project. I wish to develop a GMDH type Polynomial Neural Network package\r\nin R. I have used GMDH (Group Method of Data Handling) for my Master’s project in\r\nGeophysics. I have always been interested in machine learning and have used R\r\nin few of my geophysics related projects.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><span> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">GMDH is a nonlinear regression\r\nmethod </span><a href=\"http://www.gmdh.net/articles/history/polynomial.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.gmdh.net/articles/history/polynomial.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351712613000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0zYcAQtQhSx5i7YjxznI5w\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">(Ivakhnenko, 1971)</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">\r\nbut also shares the characteristics of both unsupervised and supervised artificial\r\nneural networks. </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">GMDH\r\nhas the advantage of automatically determining the best network structure and\r\nnumber of nodes without overtraining the data. GMDH methods are used in fields such as\r\nbiomedical modeling, econometric forecasting, environmental systems.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">It would be great if you\r\ncould guide me further. </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Regards<br clear=\"all\">\r\n</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Sincerely</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Prashant\r\nKumar</span></p></div>"
